### order-placed event request
POST {{baseUrl}}/order-placed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "1234",
  "customerId": "343",
  "totalAmount": 99.99,
  "timestamp": "2025-08-25T10:00:00Z",
  "products": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-456",
      "name": "Sample Product",
      "price": 99.99,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}
###